Additional upstream correctness and hardening fixes backported onto the Ruby
3.2.11 source tree (the final 3.2.x release). Ruby 3.2 is end-of-life, so there
is no newer 3.2.x release to pick them up from and they are carried here.

Generated against the pristine ruby-3.2.11.tar.gz
(sha256 b3eeabd6636f334531db3ffdc3229eb05e524740e6c84fdc043720573cf2f8b2).
Apply with:  patch -p1 --fuzz=0 < ruby-3.2.11-upstream-fixes-2026-11.patch

Touches the string case-mapping code (string.c, enc/*.c) and the bundled regex
engine (re.c, regparse.c, regcomp.c, regexec.c, regint.h, regerror.c,
include/ruby/onigmo.h).
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
